<title>USA: PrimeEnergy plans deep exploratory well.</title>
<headline>PrimeEnergy plans deep exploratory well.</headline>
<dateline>STAMFORD, Conn. 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>PrimeEnergy Corp said Friday it plans to drill a deep exploratory well on the Texas Gulf Coast to test the Miocene and Frio formations.</p>
<p>3DX Technologies Inc is a working interest owner, PrimeEnergy said in a brief statement that provided no further details.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.))</p>
